evals.prompt:
After moving our map screen to Compose, the location indicator listener fires twice and sometimes the map setup runs again when the user selects a store. Code:

MapboxMap(mapViewportState = viewport) {
    MapEffect(selectedStoreId) { mapView ->
        mapView.location.updateSettings { enabled = true; puckBearingEnabled = true }
        mapView.location.addOnIndicatorPositionChangedListener { point -> lastPoint = point }
        mapView.compass.updateSettings { marginTop = 80f }
    }
}
